# Ciyahi website — read HANDOVER.md at the repo root first

This is the Ciyahi Limited marketing site (enterprise AI implementation company; flagship product
InvoAIce.io, live in production). React 19 + Vite 8 + React Router v7, no backend. `npm run dev` for the
dev server (port 5173) — verify visual changes in the browser, this is a design-sensitive site.

Full context, site map, and design-system component catalog: **HANDOVER.md**.
Condensed always-on rules: **.cursor/rules/project-context.mdc**.

Non-negotiables:
- No client names anywhere on the site.
- The insurance-brokerage case study's risk modeling and pricing systems are THIRD-PARTY — Ciyahi built
  the automation feeding them, not the systems themselves. Never imply otherwise.
- Ateequeullah Khan = Non-Executive Director & Co-Founder (H-1B constraint, don't change). Iqbal Shaikh =
  active Director/CEO, listed first.
- Don't reintroduce finance-only positioning or the DM Serif Display font — both were deliberately
  replaced.
- Keep `/services` (generic capabilities) and `/use-cases` (concrete delivered proof) separate — this was
  explicitly split after the case-study content made Services feel bloated.

Read HANDOVER.md before any non-trivial change.
